      "sourceGaps": [
        "The archive contains the complete question packet and the official interleaved solution packet. The separate official answer sheets referred to in the instructions are absent from this archive folder. Original printed errors are retained: A1(c)'s solution uses $z'_x$ although the question defines $y(x)$; A2(b.iii)'s solution writes radius $r+\\delta r$ although the question defines $r=r_0+\\delta r$; A3's key refers to “part (b)” in its part a.iii check, and B1's key calls the rod a “disc”. B2's printed energy expression uses $2.0\\times10^7\\ \\mathrm{J}$ although the question gives energy density in J/kg. The “this paper” references in B2 and B3 have no recoverable URI in the supplied PDF."
